        <mxCell id="cZmoxPCs9f-jtr3tjs0I-3" value="&lt;b&gt;1. Создать заявку&lt;br&gt;2. Получить предложение&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;по заявке&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;[REST / SOAP / GraphQL]&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="cZmoxPCs9f-jtr3tjs0I-2">
